<article class="env-corollary" id="0F30E5">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0F30E5">Corollary <span data-tag="0F30E5">7.3.2.10</span>.</a> Let $X$ be a topological space, $U \subseteq X$ an open subset and $Y = X - U$. The inclusion of $Y$ in $X$ induces a closed immersion of $\infty $-topoi $\Shv (Y) \rightarrow \Shv (X)$ and an equivalence $\Shv (Y) \rightarrow \Shv (X)/U$. </p>
</article>